 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 519118,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Oksana deposits $5,000 in a CD that earns 3% compounded annually. How much is the CD worth after 4 years?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The interest <span data-math=\"(I)\"></span> is the principal <span data-math=\"(P)\"></span> times the annual simple interest rate as a decimal <span data-math=\"(r)\"></span> times the time in years <span data-math=\"(t)\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"I = P \\times r \\times t\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 1: End of the first year</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"I = 5,000 \\times 0.03 \\times 1 = 150\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"T = P + I = 5,000 + 150 = \\$ 5,150\"></span></p>\n<p>The interest is added into the account and you begin earning interest on $5,150.</p>\n<p>Step 2: End of the second year</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"I = 5,150 \\times 0.03 \\times 1 = 154.50\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"T = P + I = 5,150 + 154.50 = \\$ 5,304.50\"></span></p>\n<p>The interest is added into the account and you begin earning interest on $5,304.50.</p>\n<p>Step 3: End of the third year</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"I = 5,304.50 \\times 0.03 \\times 1 = 159.14\"></span></td>\n<td>(rounded)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"T = P + I = 5,304.50 + 159.14 = \\$ 5,463.64\"></span></p>\n<p>The interest is added into the account and you begin earning interest on $5,463.64.</p>\n<p>Step 4: End of the fourth year</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"I = 5,463.64 \\times 0.03 \\times 1 = 163.91\"></span></td>\n<td>(rounded)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"T = P + I = 5,463.64 + 163.91 = \\$ 5,627.54\"></span></p>\n<p>The interest is added into the account and you begin earning interest on $5,627.54.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "The CD is worth $5,627.54 after 4 years."
    }
   ],
